OL,3,AHow the downfall of Serbia's VuDMiDK
OL,4,Amirrored that of Hungary's Orban
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen they met in northern Serbia last
OL,7,FNovember, Serbian President Aleksandar
OL,8,FVuDMiDK and Hungarian Prime Minister
OL,9,FViktor Orban could hardly have guessed
OL,10,Fthey would both be out of power within
OL,11,Fa year.
OL,13,FBoth were ousted by popular movements -
OL,14,FOrban fell first, in April, defeated by
OL,15,FPeter Magyar's Tisza party. Then last
OL,16,FSunday a student movement less than two
OL,17,Fyears old won Serbia's parliamentary
OL,18,Felections by a landslide.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
